      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cards 1–6 are the named-control path. Cards 7–9 are independent read-only observation/viewer paths; the terminal reads the same owner windows directly.\nGenerated-cache removal is a separate explicit command and refuses active application listeners. Feeder and all nine failure exercises retain outcomes and\nrestoration evidence.",
      "originalText": "Cards 1–6 are the named-control path. Cards 7–9 are independent read-only observation/viewer paths; the terminal reads the same owner windows directly.\nGenerated-cache removal is a separate explicit command and refuses active application listeners. Feeder and all nine failure exercises retain outcomes and\nrestoration evidence.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
